{
 "note": "Dry run of the visible-gap checker (S6) on today's approved entry screens and Home v3. Read-only: pages are loaded with ?capture= / file URLs; nothing in ui-screens/ changes. 'roles' maps the approved pages' local classes onto the D-108 roles (the design-system defaults cover the .tm-* classes).",
 "viewports": ["390x844", "360x640"],
 "ignore": [".login-keyboard", ".kbd", ".review-controls", ".review", ".sr-only", ".visually-hidden"],
